{"id":"word:hebrew:H214","type":"word","title":"אוֹצָר","subtitle":"H214 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a depository","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to אוֹצָר (H214) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 79 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"אוֹצָר (ʼôwtsâr) means a depository First listed occurrence: 1Chr 9 26."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"אוֹצָר","transliteration":"ʼôwtsâr","pronunciation":"o-tsaw'","strong":"H214","lemmaId":"hebrew:H214","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["אֹצְר֣וֹת","אֽוֹצְרוֹת֙","לְ/אוֹצַ֣ר","אוֹצַ֥ר","אֹצְר֖וֹת"],"morphs":[["HNcmpc",17],["HR/Ncmpc",7],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp3ms",6],["HC/R/Ncmpc",5],["HC/Ncmpc",5],["HNcmsc",4],["HNcmpa",4],["HR/Ncmsc",3],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp1cs",3],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"a depository","usage":"armory, cellar, garner, store(-house), treasure(-house) (-y).","full":"H214. otsar אוֺצָר noun masculine Prov 15:16 treasure, store, treasury, storehouse (so Aramaic, also ) — אוֺצָר 15:16 +; construct אוֺצַר Josh 6:19 +; suffix אוֺצָרוֺ Deut 28:12 2 t.; plural אוֺצָרוֺת Joel 1:17 +; אֹצָרוֺת Prov 21:6 +; construct אוֺצְרוֺת Micah 6:10 +; אֹצְרוֺת Job 38:22 +; plural suffix אוֺצְרֹתָֽי׃ Deut 32:34 ; Isa 39:4 ; אֹצְרֹתָֽי׃ Deut 32:34 ; אוֺצְרוֺתֶיךָ Jer 17:3 ; אוֺצְרֹתָם Isa 30:6 ; אֹצְרֹתֵיהֶם Prov 8:21 , etc. &#8212; 1 treasure(s) , Generally plural (gold, silver, costly utensils, etc.) Josh 6:19 , 24 ; Isa 2:7 ; 30:6 ; 45:3 ( ׳א חשֶׁח , i.e. concealed, hoarded) Hosea 13:15 ; Jer 15:13 ; 17:3 ; 20:5 ; 48:7 ; 49:4 ; 51:13 ; 1Kin 14:26 (twice in verse); 2Kin 24:13 (twice in verse), perhaps also Isa 39:2 , 4 = 2Kin 20:13 , 15 ; wealth Prov 15:16 ; 21:6 , 20 ; gathered for temple-building (singular) ׳א י ׳בֵּית 1Chr 29:8 , ׳א הַמְּלָאכָה Ezra 2:69 = Neh 7:70 , also 7:69 (compare 1Chr 26:27 ). 2 store , supply of food, drink, etc., 2Chr 11:11 ; 1Chr 27:27-28 , figurative ׳א רֶשַׁע Micah 6:10 ; Prov 10:2 ; י ׳יִרְאַת אוֺצָרוֺ הִיא Isa 33:6 . 3 אוֺצָר בֵּית a. treasure-house Neh 10:39 compare Dan 1:2 ; b. storehouse, magazine Mal 3:10 ; & without בית a. treasure-house or chamber, treasury 1Kin 7:51 ; 15:18 (twice in verse); 2Kin 12:19 ; 14:14 ; 16:8 ; 18:15 ; Jer 38:11 ; 50:37 (?) 1Chr 9:26 ; 26:20 (twice in verse); 26:22 , 24 , 26 ; 28:12 (twice in verse); 2Chr 5:1 ; 16:2 (?) 32:27 compare Ezek 28:4 ; b. storehouse Joel 1:17 ; Prov 8:21 ; 1Chr 27:25 (twice in verse); Neh 13:12-13 , c. magazine of weapons, figurative of Yahweh's armoury Jer 50:25 ; d. storehouses of God for rain, snow, hail, wind, sea Deut 28:12 ; Job 38:22 (twice in verse); Jer 10:13 ; 51:16 ; Psa 135:7 ; 33:7 . אֶקְדָּח see קדח .","rootNote":"from 686 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 9 26","keyReferences":["1Chr 9 26","1Chr 26 20","1Chr 26 20","1Chr 26 22","1Chr 26 24","1Chr 26 26","1Chr 27 25","1Chr 27 25"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":79,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 9 26","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/אֹצְר֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 20","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֽוֹצְרוֹת֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 20","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/לְ/אֹֽצְר֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֹצְר֖וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הָ/אֹצָרֽוֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmpa"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 26","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"אֹצְר֤וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 2